  "solution_ref": "$S'(t)=f(t)\\{1+f'(t)\\}$, $1+f'(t)=\\frac13(t-3)(t-7)$ → $t=3$에서 최대. $S(3)=\\frac19\\int_0^3x(x-6)(x-9)dx+\\frac12\\cdot36=\\left(\\frac94-15+27\\right)+18=\\frac{129}4$",
